spending too much and no one does anything.

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:10.380
That's what I think would happen in the whole
system

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:12.230
when I read the analysis.

00:10:12.230 --> 00:10:17.650
It seems as though the access piece may well
be as it's expected to be.

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:21.750
The quality of care piece, if managed correctly,
