critique.

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:33.980
Yeah.

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:38.240
And I think that that's, I think that's why
if Medicare for all was to pass, that's how

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:39.240
it would work.

